                "word": "satyr",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cdf6e8e5-10e2-4af2-bbeb-befc21051cba",
                        "entry_id": "686ece22-badb-3947-993d-99792f97f7bf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "satyrs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db638120-bd90-3872-a066-cd9aa4993f2d",
                        "entry_id": "686ece22-badb-3947-993d-99792f97f7bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sylvan deity or demigod, male companion of Pan or Dionysus, represented as part man and part goat, and characterized by riotous merriment and lasciviousness, sometimes pictured with a perpetual erection."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Greek"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "489a6a9a-819c-43c9-812d-128139b81e4f",
                                "sense_id": "db638120-bd90-3872-a066-cd9aa4993f2d",
                                "text": "Rough Satyrs danced; and Fauns, with cloven heel, / From the glad sound would not be absent long.\nmale variation of nymphs"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ee5e5e6-c832-3f40-90c6-67d25445e07d",
                        "entry_id": "686ece22-badb-3947-993d-99792f97f7bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of faun."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Roman"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c28f784-8ede-3450-a54f-afdd04dd125b",
                        "entry_id": "686ece22-badb-3947-993d-99792f97f7bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A lecherous man."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5f9e63f6-a7c9-3bb1-a823-8339c048f37d",
                        "entry_id": "686ece22-badb-3947-993d-99792f97f7bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of various butterflies of the nymphalid subfamily Satyrinae, having brown wings marked with eyelike spots; a meadow brown."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
